  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDH-NICFI partnership program - Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will facilitate long-term systemic change in the Sinoe and Lofa landscapes, aiming towards better incomes for farmers and communities, and a better environment through reduced deforestation and ecosystem loss. The program focuses on the cocoa supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
